<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>The Orpheus Institute — Internal Access Node</title>

<style>
  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Share+Tech+Mono&display=swap');

  body {
    margin: 0;
    background-color: #0b0b0c;
    color: #b8b8b8;
    font-family: 'Share Tech Mono', monospace;
    background-image: radial-gradient(circle at center, #101011 0%, #050506 80%);
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }

  .overlay {
    position: fixed;
    top: 0; left: 0;
    width: 100%; height: 100%;
    background: repeating-linear-gradient(
      rgba(0,0,0,0.02) 0px,
      rgba(0,0,0,0.02) 1px,
      transparent 2px,
      transparent 3px
    );
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 10;
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 8% auto;
    padding: 20px;
    background: rgba(20,20,22,0.45);
    border: 1px solid #222;
    box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.7);
  }

  h1 {
    color: #d0d0d0;
    font-weight: normal;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    text-align: center;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .divider {
    border-top: 1px solid #303030;
    margin: 20px 0;
  }

  p {
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: #a8a8a8;
  }

  .warning {
    color: #c73b3b;
    text-shadow: 0 0 4px #440000;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .terminal {
    background: #0a0a0a;
    color: #7ac97a;
    padding: 10px;
    border: 1px solid #222;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin-top: 15px;
  }

  footer {
    margin-top: 30px;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: #555;
  }

  /* Flicker effect for abandoned look */
  @keyframes flicker {
    0%, 18%, 22%, 25%, 53%, 57%, 100% {
      opacity: 1;
    }
    20%, 24%, 55% {
      opacity: 0.4;
    }
  }
  .flicker {
    animation: flicker 6s infinite;
  }
</style>
</head>

<body>
<div class="overlay"></div>
<div class="container">
  <h1 class="flicker">The Orpheus Institute</h1>
  <div class="divider"></div>

  <p><strong>Department of Allocations and Internal Studies</strong></p>

  <p>Access Node: <span class="warning">INTERNAL ARCHIVE / CONNECTION UNSTABLE</span></p>

  <div class="terminal">
    > user.login [accepted]<br>
    > last recorded activity: <span class="flicker">13 years, 6 months ago</span><br>
    > warning: archival integrity at 42%<br>
    > directive: maintain silence
  </div>

  <p>
    Fragments of research remain. Systems hum without direction.
    Whoever was meant to monitor the Institute has long since stopped logging in.
    A faint static lingers, whispering of the <em>Pallid Veil</em>.
  </p>

  <p class="warning">
    [!] Connection to Archive E-13 is corrupted. Manual override required.
  </p>

  <footer>
    &copy; The Orpheus Institute • Internal Network • Access Level: Terminated
  </footer>
</div>
</body>
</html>
